        "answer": "Constructs CoD.hud_hacked_hero_widget.new with the exact receiver/menu/controller/layout arguments below. Creates self as LUI.UIElement.new, Hacked2 as LUI.UIImage.new, Hacked as LUI.UIImage.new. Stores source state predicates in order Hacked. Owns 6 nested callable scopes, each with its separate delivery/invocation contract. Runs PostLoadFunc( self, f1_arg1, f1_arg0 ) only under its exact guard and at its original source position. All property/asset/model/state/navigation/return effects remain in the ordered statement contract; construction and storing callbacks do not prove the original game displays or loads this widget.",
